      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישָׁן</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino.</strong> um filho de Seir <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישָׁ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:21\" href=\"/Genesis.36.21\">Gn 36.21</a> (𝔊 Ῥισών; assim v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:28\" href=\"/Genesis.36.28\">Gn 36.28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:30\" href=\"/Genesis.36.30\">Gn 36.30</a> cf. Di) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.38\">1Cr 1.38</a>; (v. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:42\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.42\">1Cr 1.42</a> leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישׁוֹן</span>, ver este verbete) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:26\" href=\"/Genesis.36.26\">Gn 36.26</a> (leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישׁוֹן</span> 𝔊 𝔖 𝔙 Ol Di) v. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:30\" href=\"/Genesis.36.30\">Gn 36.30</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּישָׁ֖ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:28\" href=\"/Genesis.36.28\">Gn 36.28</a>.",
