      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דַּךְ</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo. esmagado, oprimido</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">דַּךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:21\" href=\"/Psalms.74.21\">Sl 74.21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּ֑ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:10\" href=\"/Psalms.9.10\">Sl 9.10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:18\" href=\"/Psalms.10.18\">Sl 10.18</a>; plural com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּכָּ֑ו</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.28\">Pv 26.28</a> (Baer; outras edições <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּכָּיו</span>)—poético; sempre figuradamente, <em>oprimido, aflito</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:10\" href=\"/Psalms.9.10\">Sl 9.10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:18\" href=\"/Psalms.10.18\">Sl 10.18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יתום</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:21\" href=\"/Psalms.74.21\">Sl 74.21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span> e <span dir=\"rtl\">אביון</span>); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.28\">Pv 26.28</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּכָּו</span> = <em>os que por ela são esmagados</em> (uma língua mentirosa).",
