      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּלַג</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo. saltar (</strong>hebraico novo <em>saltar por cima, saltar</em> (um versículo), omitir<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹלֵג</span> <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:9\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.9\">Sf 1.9</a> <em>saltar</em>, com artigo <em>aquele que salta</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">על־הַמִּפְתָּן</span>; 𝔊 <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 5:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.5.5\">1Sm 5.5</a> ὑπερβαίνοντες ὑπερβαίνουσιν = <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּלֹג יִדְלֹ֑גוּ</span> cf. Dr.<br><strong>Piel.</strong>  Imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יְדַלֵּג</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.6\">Is 35.6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲדַלֶּג־</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:30\" href=\"/Psalms.18.30\">Sl 18.30</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.30\">2Sm 22.30</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">מְדַלֵּג</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.8\">Ct 2.8</a>;—<em>saltar, saltar por cima</em> com acusativo <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁוּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:30\" href=\"/Psalms.18.30\">Sl 18.30</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:30\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.30\">2Sm 22.30</a>; absoluto <em>saltar como o cervo</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יְד׳ כָּאַיָּל פִּסֵּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.6\">Is 35.6</a>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">על</span> de lugar <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 2:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.2.8\">Ct 2.8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְקַפֵּץ</span>).",
