      "preview": "דָּמָה²: verbo: cessar, fazer cessar, exterminar, destruir.",
      "html": "† II. <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּמָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo. cessar, fazer cessar, exterminar, destruir</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Perfeito 1.ª pessoa singular <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּמִיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.2\">Jr 6.2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וְדָמִ֫יתִי</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:5\" href=\"/Hosea.4.5\">Os 4.5</a>; imperfeito 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּדְמֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:49\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.49\">Lm 3.49</a>; <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:3\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.3\">Lm 3.3</a> feminino plural jussivo <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּדְמֶינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.17\">Jr 14.17</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  intransitivo <em>cessar</em> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.17\">Jr 14.17</a> (olhos de chorar) <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 3:49\" href=\"/Lamentations.3.49\">Lm 3.49</a> (<em>idem.</em>) <strong>2.</strong>  <em>fazer cessar, exterminar, destruir</em>, com acusativo Israel (sob a figura de <span dir=\"rtl\">בת־ציון</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.2\">Jr 6.2</a>; (sob a figura de <span dir=\"rtl\">אִמֶּ֑ךָ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:5\" href=\"/Hosea.4.5\">Os 4.5</a>.<br><strong>Nifal.</strong>  Perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.1\">Is 15.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.1\">Is 15.1</a> +; 3.ª pessoa feminina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמְתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.5\">Jr 47.5</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina singular <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמֵיתָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:5\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.5\">Ob 1.5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמֵיתָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.2\">Ez 32.2</a>; 1.ª pessoa singular <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמֵיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.5\">Is 6.5</a>; 3.ª pessoa plural <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:6\" href=\"/Hosea.4.6\">Os 4.6</a> +; infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:15\" href=\"/Hosea.10.15\">Os 10.15</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">נִדְמֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:7\" href=\"/Hosea.10.7\">Os 10.7</a>; <em>ser exterminado, destruído, arruinado</em>, de cidade <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.1\">Is 15.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.1\">Is 15.1</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֻׁדַּד</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 47:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.47.5\">Jr 47.5</a>; de povo <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:6\" href=\"/Hosea.4.6\">Os 4.6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:11\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.11\">Sf 1.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Obadiah 1:5\" href=\"/Obadiah.1.5\">Ob 1.5</a>; de rei <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:7\" href=\"/Hosea.10.7\">Os 10.7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:15\" href=\"/Hosea.10.15\">Os 10.15</a><sup>(×2)</sup> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.2\">Ez 32.2</a>; de animais <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:13\" href=\"/Psalms.49.13\">Sl 49.13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 49:21\" href=\"/Psalms.49.21\">Sl 49.21</a>; <em>estar arruinado, perdido</em>, profeta à vista de Yahweh <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 6:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.6.5\">Is 6.5</a>.",
